blocks.english:
Virgin Mother of God, He whom the whole world cannot contain
Enclosed Himself in thy womb, made man.
Hence rightly shall all ages call thee blessed;
Hence peoples honour thee as Mother and Lady.
Receive the honours which devout people strive to offer thee;
Grant the attentive help they seek by prayer.
Great glory to the Father; equal glory to the Son;
Equal honour to Thee with them both, loving Spirit. Amen.
